# Anashwar Enterprise Fleet - Header Includes

This directory contains global configuration definitions and cryptographic constants for the ESP32 Fleet:

- `config.h`: Fleet network parameters, HiveMQ broker host/port, topic definitions, fallback SSIDs, cryptographic security salt (`AnashwarEnterprise2026SecureSalt`), and pre-registered node identities.

For independent project nodes, you can reference `Anashwar_ESP32_Fleet_Node.ino` in the root directory or `examples/Anashwar_ESP32_Fleet_Node/`.
